@clawsweeper re-review

Addressed the exact-head shared-toast finding in `7e4b9faa454`:

- moved completion FIFO ownership from the feature presenter into the shared toast host;
- preserved ordinary `showToast()` replacement priority, so observer/error notices are not displaced by the next queued completion;
- consolidated the regression at `ui/src/lib/toast.test.ts`, where the old code failed after the unrelated toast was dismissed;
- kept the approved shortcut policy: background launch owns Cmd/Ctrl+Enter in default mode, while queue-row Steer remains available.

Verification:

- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs ui/src/lib/toast.test.ts ui/src/app/app-host.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/critical-observer-notice.test.ts ui/src/lib/sessions/background-turns.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-composer-actions.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-view.test.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-send-submit.test.ts` — 374 passed.
- `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs run --config test/vitest/vitest.ui-e2e.config.ts --configLoader runner ui/src/e2e/chat-flow.active-run-follow-ups.e2e.test.ts` — 7 passed in 19.62s.
- UI and core-test tsgo lanes, focused oxlint/stylelint, dead-code, assertion-safety, format, i18n, and `git diff --check` — passed.
- `OPENCLAW_BUILD_ALL_NO_PNPM=1 node scripts/ui.js build` — passed all Control UI performance budgets.
- `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode uncommitted --stream-engine-output` — clean, no accepted/actionable findings.

Repair delta: production +52/-50 (net +2); tests +21/-58 (net -37). The aggregate `check:changed --staged` wrapper was stopped only after its max-lines guard printed `OK` but did not exit; the remaining planned checks were run directly above.

Rebased and repaired at exact head `68b2f4972397cf3f2a5bb8c8f80614c7bd7f0142` on current `main` (`e2c92fce4d8bb32ddadf1150e663013c2ad92095`).

The latest timeout-contract finding is addressed at the authoritative owner boundary:

- direct background creates stop after a metadata-free timeout because their authoritative started run is no longer observable;
- placed starts retry a snapshotless timeout only while `placementStartup.hasPendingTurn(key)` confirms the owner still has live work;
- explicit `pending` remains nonterminal and continues to the exact-run terminal result.

Fresh exact-head proof:

- focused owner suites: 101 passed (19 Code Mode persistence tests and 82 New Session/composer/toast tests);
- timeout lifecycle coverage proves direct terminal timeout and placed timeout → pending → success;
- mocked-Gateway Control UI E2E: 5 passed across desktop, mobile, Modifier+Enter, foreground creation, and startup readiness;
- refreshed exact-head desktop/mobile screenshots and recordings are embedded in the PR body;
- full `node scripts/check-changed.mjs` passed, including core/UI types, lint, formatting, i18n, boundaries, dependencies, and dead-code scans;
- fresh autoreview: clean, no accepted/actionable findings (0.98).
- exact-head hosted CI is green, including `openclaw/ci-gate`: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/actions/runs/33427688968
- `OPENCLAW_TESTBOX=1 scripts/pr prepare-run 128050` completed successfully; hosted gates passed and prep head equals PR head `68b2f4972397cf3f2a5bb8c8f80614c7bd7f0142`.

Known proof gaps: none.

Worked on by:
- @Takhoffman

